  "question": {
    "text": "If both the mean and the standard deviation of <math><mn>50</mn></math> observations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></math> are equal to <math><mn>16</mn></math>, then the mean of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>50</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is"
  },
